kes at  least one overt act in furtherance of  the conspiracy for Trump to achieve the  desired result he had to get Mike Pence  to ignore the Constitutional duties you  might recall that the 12th amendment  gives the Vice President in their role  as the president of the Senate the job  of certifying the result of the  presidential election quote the  president of the Senate shall in the  presence of the Senate and the House of  Representatives open all of the  certificates and the votes shall then be  counted the person having the greatest  number of votes for president shall be  the president the Electoral count Act of  1887 reiterates that the vice  president's role is ministerial in that  his job is just to count the votes not  to choose which votes to count and which  to reject but while Trump was being told  that he lost the election lawyer John  Eastman and others quote devised a plan  whereby vice president Pence wood as a  presiding officer declare that certain  electoral votes from certain States  could not be counted at the Joint  session John Eastman knew before  proposing this plan that it was not  legal despite knowing that the plan was  illegal Trump pursued it anyway  including for the 187 minutes when the  attack happened Congress was being  evacuated to underground tunnels and  even after he was aware that the mob was  chanting about hanging my Pence count  three of the criminal referral refers to  a conspiracy to make false statements  under 18 USC 1001 this is the classic  lying to the government provision and  this count was about Trump conspiring  with other people to submit slates of  fake electors to Congress in the  National Archives these certificates  were patently false since Biden won each  of those States and the state's  authorities certified Biden's Victory  now In fairness whether a statement or  act is material for the purposes of  section 1001 can be a contentious issue  but here the report says that at best  quote it can hardly be